rstand complex logic.",isComment:!0,rating:4.2},{id:"4",name:"Parth gup Ta",photo:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI8p78qOy4zXpD5SruQabi7FJUJXWpr8_R8jUlJTssTY2tktw=s64-c-rp-mo-br100",designation:"Frontend Developer",message:"Learning at Sheryians Coding School has been an amazing experience! The mentors explain everything so clearly, and the hands-on projects really help in understanding the concepts better. The team is super helpful and motivating.",isComment:!0,rating:4.7},{id:"5",name:"Mohd Siraj",photo:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXBzkmRxwA1hlxiptQHZJnja6TZn97tHnX8l2jKQ7AA_LBtUz4n=s64-c-rp-mo-br100",designation:"Web Developer",message:"I had a great experience at Coaching. The teachers are highly supportive and knowledgeable. They explain every concept clearly and make learning enjoyable. The environment is positive and motivating.",isComment:!0,rating:4.1},{id:"6",name:"Om Singhal",photo:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlzeJC_n1ztgPTSBIg-ReP5z9ayISJTkv0udcszLP2gYWi8dyE=s64-c-rp-mo-br100",designation:"Backend Developer",message:"🌟 Sheryians Coding School – Best Place to Learn Coding Online! 🌟 I am currently learning coding online from Sheryians Coding School, and my experience has been top-notch. The curriculum is very well structured.",isComment:!0,rating:4.4},{id:"7",name:"Aditya Kumar",photo:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUNdI9v6r5ncY-YaS9WfLHRX7rs8VSXYon-DjJ89NamEvuV5vtI=s64-c-rp-mo-br100",designation:"Coding Mentor",message:"We proudly share our teaching journey with Sheryians Coding School, helping students build future-ready coding skills. Provided educational guidance and hands-on coding mentorship at Sheryiansh.",isComment:!0,rating:4.2},{id:"8",name:"Akash Warade",photo:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6clBm3K5pH5Chp9QFwNOWquo-bZgRroL1D5ZXVSBnzktp_7Pb=s64-c-rp-mo-br100",designation:"MERN Stack Student",message:"I am a student of MERN-15 Batch and I am giving these review after spending 3 months here currently learning full stack web development and these guys are literally amazing specially Sarthak bhaiya.",isComment:!0,rating:4.9},{id:"9",name:"Pragati Nayak",photo:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIdNt3gaSp6GHsLqCG1X_4JIHK39abe2KhSuPBFsQmpY21eYR8=s64-c-rp-mo-br100",designation:"Junior Web Developer",message:"This school is not just school but a full of memories i am gathering here full of knowledge...... devendra bhaiya harsh bhaiya sarthak bhaiya all are amazing and they are very very helpful.",isComment:!0,rating:4.3},{id:"10",name:"Samarth Jain",photo:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcH_XErZbHkM5_0RNlNtiVNWats-GiUl19D4TLcAH7uC145W8XPA=s64-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100",designation:"Local Guide & Coder",message:"Really very amazing place to learn new technologies and life facts too, calling all aspiring coders and tech enthusiasts! If you're looking to embark on a transformative coding journey, Sheryians is the destination.",isComment:!0,rating:4.8},{id:"11",name:"Akshat Sahu",photo:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWTP-gt5AGK-AiTDBw0GI36Bol_nJr3ttYxH25XPjPmCWHpgsG7=s64-c-rp-mo-br100",designation:"Software Developer",message:"The best institute is in Bhopal. I have learnt a lot by coming here. After coming here, I just started coding and now I am really liking it and getting interested.",isComment:!0,rating:4.7}],l4=[{title:"Are Sheryians courses suitable for beginners?",content:"Yes, Sheryians provides beginner-friendly courses along with advanced concepts. Our courses are designed in a way that suits beginners as well as professionals who wants to learn advance concepts.",isOpened:!0},{title:"Does Sheryians Coding School provide placement assistance?",content:"Sheryians Offers placement assistance through career guidance, interview preparation, and resume support. Students also get opportunities to connect with hiring partners based on their skills and performances through the assessments.",isOpened:!1},{title:"What programming languages and technologies are covered in the courses?",content:"Sheryians covers a wide range of industry needed technologies including web development modern JavaScript frameworks, backend technology, and industry relevant tools to help students build real-world skills.",isOpened:!1},{title:"Are the classes live or pre-recorded, and can I access recordings later?",content:"Sheryians offers both live and recorded sessions. Students can access class recordings anytime, allowing them to revise concepts and learn at their own pace.",isOpened:!1},{title:"Do students get real-world project experience during the course?",content:"Yes, students work on real world projects that helps them apply theoretical knowledge practically. Our projects are specifically designed in a way that integrates key concepts along with modern technologies helping them strengthen portfolios and improve job readiness.",isOpened:!1}],s4=[{id:0,name:"Afghanistan",code:"+93",alpha:"AF"},{id:1,name:"Albania",code:"+355",alpha:"AL"},{id:2,name:"Algeria",code:"+213",alpha:"DZ"},{id:3,name:"American Samoa",code:"+1-684",alpha:"AS"},{id:4,name:"Andorra",code:"+376",alpha:"AD"},{id:5,name:"Angola",code:"+244",alpha:"AO"},{id:6,name:"Anguilla",code:"+1-264",alpha:"AI"},{id:7,name:"Antigua and Barbuda",code:"+1-268",alpha:"AG"},{id:8,name:"Argentina",code:"+54",alpha:"AR"},{id:9,name:"Armenia",code:"+374",alpha:"AM"},{id:10,name:"Aruba",code:"+297",alpha:"AW"},{id:11,name:"Australia",code:"+61",alpha:"AU"},{id:12,name:"Austria",code:"+43",alpha:"AT"},{id:13,name:"Azerbaijan",code:"+994",alpha:"AZ"},{id:14,name:"Bahamas",code:"+1-242",alpha:"BS"},{id:15,name:"Bahrain",code:"+973",alpha:"BH"},{id:16,name:"Bangladesh",code:"+880",alpha:"BD"},{id:17,name:"Barbados",code:"+1-246",alpha:"BB"},{id:18,name:"Belarus",code:"+375",alpha:"BY"},{id:19,name:"Belgium",code:"+32",alpha:"BE"},{id:20,name:"Belize",code:"+501",alpha:"BZ"},{id:21,name:"Benin",code:"+229",alpha:"BJ"},{id:22,name:"Bermuda",code:"+1-441",alpha: