Placement-Focused",description:"Showcase portfolio building, interview prep, and placement assistance. we prepare you for the real hiring process."},{id:3,number:"(03)",title:"Proven Results",description:"Share success stats like ‘80% of students with complete portfolios got placed in the last 3 cohorts.’"},{id:4,number:"(04)",title:"Affordable & fair Pricing",description:"Position Sheryians as offering premium education at student-friendly costs."},{id:5,number:"(05)",title:"Mentor & Community Support",description:"Highlight access to mentors, doubt-solving, and a 25,000+ student community."}],o4=[{id:"1",title:"How to Get Placed in Tech in 2025 (No Luck, Just Skills)",thumbnail:P("c21f84240dbae93ed16ad90a.webp","courses"),views:"43k Views",likes:"2.8k Likes",url:"https://youtu.be/VeAYpzd4e4U"},{id:"2",title:"Complete Web Development Roadmap 2025",thumbnail:"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SDQpAzYsfYk/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCNAFEJQDSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAIhCGAHYAQHiAQoIGBACGAY4AUAB&rs=AOn4CLBJt8JKHBCZFwDgawMEHuBnSKLfuwz",views:"128k Views",likes:"6.2k Likes",url:"https://youtu.be/SDQpAzYsfYk"},{id:"3",title:"Master JavaScript in 30 Days - Full Course",thumbnail:"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/a-wVHL0lpb0/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCNAFEJQDSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAIhCGAHYAQHiAQoIGBACGAY4AUAB&rs=AOn4CLC8Lo_X7R1iA6khCfBPmILwvnORmg",views:"840k Views",likes:"22k Likes",url:"https://youtu.be/a-wVHL0lpb0"},{id:"4",title:"React.js Complete Tutorial for Beginners",thumbnail:"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3LRZRSIh_KE/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCNAFEJQDSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAIhCGAHYAQHiAQoIGBACGAY4AUAB&rs=AOn4CLAfEvew-k6Bn7XD6uWOvvPRNqU4RA",views:"444k Views",likes:"14k Likes",url:"https://youtu.be/3LRZRSIh_KE"},{id:"5",title:"Build a Portfolio Website from Scratch",thumbnail:"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XaEmcDMU01w/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAIhCGAHYAQHiAQoIGBACGAY4AUAB&rs=AOn4CLADuhiFxobPfIqdAe7WKWTEu1Vw8w",views:"82k Views",likes:"3.4k Likes",url:"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLbtI3_MArDOkVji53VGRyQIPBOi1nB8rC&si=CH1YLBHdvii1DGrz"}],c4=[{_id:"69aaf85ed2c69a507ba793ad",title:"3.0 Job Ready AI Powered Cohort: Complete Web Development + DSA + Gen-AI + Aptitude",metaData:{description:"Build real scalable products used by thousands of users, learn AI engineering, full stack development, DevOps, system design, and startup building all inside one live Hindi cohort.",language:"English",thumbnail:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/courses/cohort3thumbnai_E9AGbX-rJ.webp",displayVideo:"https://youtu.be/xGtcHcPVb0o"},tags:["Web-Development","DSA","MERN","Aptitute"],price:8999,state:_s.published,discountPercentage:"50",duration_weeks:30,type:Ts.live},{_id:"68da779296b89547293c7a26",title:"Data Science & Analytics with Gen AI",metaData:{description:"Gain hands-on experience in data analysis, visualization, and AI integration.",language:"Hinglish",thumbnail:P("dfd10b8ddsda936b429.webp","courses"),displayVideo:""},tags:["Data Science","Python","GenAI","Analytics"],price:6999,state:_s.published,discountPercentage:"53",duration_weeks:20,type:Ts.live},{_id:"6867e4147574bb008a1b3040",title:"2.0 Job Ready AI Powered Cohort: Complete Web Development + DSA + Gen-AI + Aptitude",metaData:{description:"null",language:"Hinglish",thumbnail:P("f0d09d530eb99c5e5e1b7b19.webp","courses"),displayVideo:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DVbvFQ1Awh8?si=UqrmDLb4hGcj8Ybo?autoplay=1&vq=hd720"},tags:["Live Classes","Javascript","DSA","Python","C++"],price:5999,state:_s.published,discountPercentage:"50",duration_weeks:4,type:Ts.live}],u4=[{name:"Harsh Vandana Sharma",role:"CEO & Founder",image:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/researchclub/harsh_QunwdHO-f.webp"},{name:"Adarsh Gupta",role:"CFO & Co-Founder",image:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/researchclub/adarsh_gUt9EaA-R.webp"},{name:"Dhanesh Malviya",role:"Co-Founder & Director",image:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/researchclub/dhanesh_SubtfgTu.webp"},{name:"Harsh Patel",role:"Head of Technology",image:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/researchclub/patel_QgYpfeYT1.webp"},{name:"Aayush Chauhan",role:"Three JS Developer",image:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/researchclub/aayush_SUViw8chNQ.webp"},{name:"Akarsh",role:"Data Scientist & Instructor",image:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/researchclub/akarsh_nf3mIcmMzI.webp"},{name:"Ali",role:"DSA Instructor",image:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/researchclub/ali_TfAD8CTGTn.webp"},{name:"Anurag",role:"Sr. Developer",image:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/researchclub/anurag_38eZBn4lG.webp"},{name:"Ankur",role:"Sr. Developer & Instructor",image:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/researchclub/ankur_ZVIEkQZgu.webp"},{name:"Sarthak",role:"MERN Developer & Instructor",image:"https://px.pixxo.io/sheryians/researchclub/sarthak_KUxiVkjvVi.webp"}],cu={"68da779296b89547293c7a26":"https://www.notion.so/Data-Science-Analytics-with-Gen-AI-27a8296c433f80a692c3dbc7b7ea5ab2","6867e4147574bb008a1b3040":"https://sheryians.notion.site/cohort-2","68470b75165226c4889001e8":"https://sheryians.notion.site/language-independent-dsa","6775253edb7d074fe7a88b85":"https://sheryians.notion.site/","69aaf85ed2c69a507ba793ad":"https://sheryians.notion.site/cohort-3","68d172aef36729b04c864830":"https://sheryians.notion.site/Ultimate-Foundation-C-3491267520c780a3b82ffd18cbbb6abc"},d4=[{id:1,number:"(01)",title:"AI Powered Discord Assistant",description:"The AI-Powered Discord Server Assistant is a next-generation project that brings the power of Generative AI directly into a Discord environment — transforming the platform into an intelligent, multimodal assistant hub."},{id:2,number:"(02)",title:"AI Code Reviewer",description:"The AI Developer Code Reviewer is an automated system that reviews code using AI-powered multi-agent analysis."},{id:3,number:"(03)",title:"AI News Research & Curation",description:"The Automated News Research and Curation system aggregates daily updates from sources like Netflix Developer Blog, GitHub Blogs, and Daily.dev using their RSS or API feeds. "},{id:4,number:"(04)",title:"Health Risk Assessment",description:"Build Health Risk Assessment, a machine learning project that uses Decision Tree Classification to evaluate an individual’s health risk based on attributes such as age, BMI, blood pressure, and lifestyle factors."},{id:5,number:"(05)",title:"Customer Segmentation",description:"Create Customer Segmentation using Spending Patterns, an unsupervised learning project that applies DBSCAN to cluster customers based on their spending behavior and purchasing frequency."},{id:6,number:"(06)",title:"The Book Vault",description:"Develop a complete Library Management System using Python, built entirely on object-oriented programming principles."},{id:7,number:"(07)",title:"44+ Projects ",description:"",link:"https://sheryians.notion.site/Project-Excercise-30a1267520c7807892bee2ab775cd08a?source=copy_link"}],h4=[{id:1,number:"(01)",title:"Shop Jacket Project",description:"A modern e-commerce fashion product page built with a clean layout, product details section, and interactive UI elements. Focuses on responsive design and premium brand-style presentation."},{id:2,number:"(02)",title:"Cotton Weave Brand Website",description:"A stylish brand-focused website showcasing a cotton fashion product with minimal design, smooth layout structure, and modern typography. Emphasizes branding and product storytelling."},{id:3,number:"(03)",title:"Trendline Modern Web UI",description:"A high-end modern UI design inspired by luxury fashion websites. Includes lookbook-style layout, elegant typography, and structured navigation for a premium feel."},{id:4,number:"(04)",title:"Dribbble Inspired Website (With Animations)",description:"A clone of the Dribbble website interface built with animations and interactive elements. Demonstrates advanced layout design, hover effects, and smooth UI transitions."},{id:5,number:"(05)",title:"Refokus Brand Experience Website",description:"A creative animated brand experience website inspired by award-winning agency designs. Includes smooth scroll animations, modern typography, and strong visual storytelling."},{id:6,number:"(06)",title:"ExoApe Modern Animated Website",description:"A visually immersive animated website with bold typography, smooth transitions, and modern web animation techniques. Focuses on creative frontend effects and motion design."},{id:7,number:"(07)",title:"10+ More Projects",description:"",link:""}],f4=[{id:1,number:"(01)",title:"ZenTask",description:"A productivity dashboard for tracking tasks, habits, and daily performance with a clean and interactive UI."},{id:2,number:"(02)",title:"Snitch",description:"A modern e-commerce platform with product listings, cart system, and a complete shopping experience."},{id:3,number:"(03)",title:"Shery-OS",description:"A real-time web-based operating system simulation that runs inside the browser with interactive windows and apps."},{id:4,number:"(04)",title:"Award-Winning Inspired Website",description:"An animation-rich website inspired by award-winning web experiences using modern UI and motion design."},{id:5,number:"(05)",title:"Moodify",description:"An AI-powered music player that detects user mood and plays music accordingly."},{id:6,number:"(06)",title:"Perplexity Clone",description:"A smart AI research assistant that summarizes information and answers user queries."},{id:7,number:"(07)",title:"53+ Projects",description:" ",link:"https://magenta-piper-31a.notion.site/Project-Exercises-16c7807053c1802d942fdc78aa800e81"}],m4=[{id:1,number:"(01)",title:"Deveb.co Hero Section",description:"A cinematic 3D hero section inspired by Deveb.co featuring immersive WebGL visuals, smooth camera motion, and interactive lighting effects."},{id:2,number:"(02)",title:"The Blob Mixer",description:"An interactive 3D blob simulation using shaders and real-time distortion effects, allowing dynamic morphing and fluid animations."},{id:3,number:"(03)",title:"Zajno.com Experience",description:"A high-end 3D interactive web experience inspired by Zajno with advanced transitions, motion design, and immersive scene composition."},{id:4,number:"(04)",title:"The Planets",description:"A space-themed Three.js project rendering animated planets, lighting, and orbital motion with realistic textures and camera controls."},{id:5,number:"(05)",title:"Many More Projects",description:"",link:""}],p4={"68da779296b89547293c7a26":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sEi0GG9M9D0","6867e4147574bb008a1b3040":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cVrbFvIXwkk","68470b75165226c4889001e8":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RSqPnRVbTgw","6775253edb7d074fe7a88b85":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GfAaK8dLtYs","66bd174049ff6f892bacdd47":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MwSRNygjiKU","6686990a672568d40bfbac7b":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DVbvFQ1Awh8","6536a79daa4702e3ac0b465e":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GD0h-bUGHto"},g4={"6867e4147574bb008a1b3040":{left:["Daily live, interactive sessions by industry experts","Complete placement-focused ecosystem (Full Stack, DSA, GenAI, Aptitude & Reasoning)","Learn modern industry tools","Instant doubt resolution via Discord","AI-powered tools and real-world projects.","Industry-relevant projects and assignments","Active peer-to-peer and mentor-led learning community"],right:["Mostly pre-recorded or outdated content","Limited to a single domain with no holistic preparation","Slow or no adoption of modern tools","Little to no doubt-solving or mentorship support","No real exposure to AI-driven workflows","Projects are minimal, guided, or purely academic","No structured learning or peer community"]},"68da779296b89547293c7a26":{left:["Python → ML → Deep Learning → GenAI → MLOps","Includes LangChain, RAG, Vector DBs, Streamlit","100% project-based learning with deployment","End-to-end MLOps using MLflow, Docker, CI/CD","Mentors are real AI developers & data scientists"],right:["Only Python and basic ML covered","Outdated content with no real-world tools","Theory-heavy approach with no hands-on projects","Stops at model training, no deploym